-- ikkada what are Null, Key, Default, and Extra?"
Field -> Column name
Type -> Data type
Null -> Whether the column can be left empty
Key -> Whether the column has a special role (like Primary Key)
Default -> Value MySQL uses if none is provided
Extra -> Additional behaviors (like auto-increment)

